  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0 - Initial version.\n                             1.0.1 - Added default constructor.\n                             1.1.0 - Target StackExchange.Redis 3.x; fix ListGraphs, which sent CommandFlags as a command argument and always returned an empty list.\n                             1.2.0 - Graph entity equality no longer depends on the order in which the server returns properties and labels, and covers temporal, point, map and numeric-array property values. Record now honours the Equals/GetHashCode contract, so equal records hash alike and can be used as dictionary keys.",
